							"elType": "widget",
							"widgetType": "text-editor",
							"settings": {
								"editor": "<p>November to February is dry and cool and is the most popular window. March to May is hot, and the end of it is hazy in the north. Roughly June to October is the green season: warm, dramatic, much quieter, with rain that usually falls in the afternoon rather than all day.</p>\n<p>Because journeys are private rather than scheduled departures, there is no fixed calendar to fit into. Tell us your dates and we confirm what works for them.</p>",
