										"_id": "40a7e82",
										"tab_title": "Do you have scheduled departures?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Journeys are private, so dates are yours rather than fixed. If that changes we will publish real availability here rather than indicative dates.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "818b78f",
										"tab_title": "When is the best time to visit Laos?",
										"tab_content": "<p>November to February for dry, cool weather. March to May is hot. June to October is green, quiet and dramatic, with afternoon rain.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "66d7e45",
										"tab_title": "How far ahead should we book?",
										"tab_content": "<p>For peak season, as early as you can. For the green season, much closer in is fine.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "490962e",
										"tab_title": "Is the green season a bad time to travel?",
										"tab_content": "<p>No — it is a different trip. Fuller rivers, greener landscape, fewer people. Some trails and back roads are harder going, and we route around that.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "b3a4a33",
										"tab_title": "Can we travel over a festival?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Yes, and it can be the highlight. It also affects transport and accommodation, so it needs planning earlier.</p>"
									},
									{
										"_id": "65b69fa",
										"tab_title": "How do we get a price?",
										"tab_content": "<p>Price is confirmed on request once the route and dates are settled.</p>"
